prebid-server-rust

This product is a Rust port of Prebid Server (https://github.com/prebid/prebid-server),
Copyright 2017 PREBID.ORG, INC, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. Its behaviour,
its tests and the test data generated from the Go code are derived from Prebid Server.

This project is independent. It is not affiliated with or endorsed by Prebid.org.


Third-party works
-----------------

To match Prebid Server byte for byte, the port also reimplements in Rust the parts of the Go
standard library and of the Go modules Prebid Server uses whose behaviour shows through it, and
some of its tests replay test data from them. Those parts are derived from the works below, at the
versions the pinned Prebid Server uses. Each keeps its own license. LICENSES/README.md lists them
with the crates that use them, and LICENSES/ holds the license texts that must be reproduced. The
Apache License, Version 2.0 is in LICENSE.

The Go programming language, Go 1.26.2 (https://go.dev): the standard library, and the test
data of its compress packages that pbs-gogzip replays.
